Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:05.58,OP-Jpn-左上,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Rumbling
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.51,0:00:05.58,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}It's coming
