Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.62,0:00:17.59,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Coming for you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.14,0:00:25.69,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}All I ever wanted to do was do right things
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.69,0:00:30.75,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I never wanted to be the king, I swear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.07,0:00:35.57,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}All I ever wanted to do was save your life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.57,0:00:41.20,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I never wanted to grab a knife, I swear
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.75,0:00:48.73,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Tearless, fearless, burning, burning
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.95,0:00:51.98,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}You tell me what have I missed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.18,0:00:55.90,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Still wandering in the deep mist
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.15,0:01:01.76,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all, slip and fall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.88,0:01:04.49,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I will never look away
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.76,0:01:10.49,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all, lose it all, lose it all
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.30,0:01:14.59,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}If I lose it all outside the wall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.59,0:01:17.78,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}Live to die another day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.34,0:01:20.31,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I don't want anything
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.31,0:01:23.55,OP-Jpn,,0,0,0,fx,{\fad(300,500)}I'm just here to…
